{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/035",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u08532",
   "en": "You always this mood-swingy? Or do I just bring it out in you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08533",
   "en": "Ah, the three little words every woman wants to hear from a man. \"I was wrong.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08534",
   "en": "All right. No harm done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08535",
   "en": "No. Usually when some smug bastard jerks me around, I just clock him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08536",
   "en": "But that would be striking a superior officer. Sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08537",
   "en": "So you used my faith to manipulate me. That's great, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08538",
   "en": "I thought you took me seriously. Guess I was wrong, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08539",
   "en": "Oh, so now we're a couple? Couples don't manipulate each other.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08540",
   "en": "If you don't mind, I have duties I should be attending to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08541",
   "en": "Genocidal sentient battleships do kind of grab your attention. Got mine, anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08542",
   "en": "The bigger they are, the more megatons we chuck. We've got warning now. We'll be ready.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08543",
   "en": "And they say I'm cynical.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08544",
   "en": "There's a reason for everything that happens, Shepard. Even if you don't understand it at the time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08545",
   "en": "What you did on Torfan. It was a hard call, but it gave you the strength you needed on this mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08546",
   "en": "What happened on Akuze. It's not easy to lose your unit. I know. But it gave you the drive you needed on this mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08547",
   "en": "Your assignment to Elysium. It put you in the right place at the right time. Your character made you rise to the occasion.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08548",
   "en": "And that got you here. Commanding the finest tin can in the Alliance fleet. This is exactly where the galaxy needs you to be.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08549",
   "en": "No pressure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08550",
   "en": "Wouldn't mind a foot massage, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08551",
   "en": "God, you're awful! How do you come up with these things?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08552",
   "en": "About a meter away. Maybe 1.2 meters.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08553",
   "en": "Sorry. I'll be serious.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08554",
   "en": "I-- I need time to think. We've been focused on the mission. When we're done, it'll be different. I swear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08555",
   "en": "You all right with that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08556",
   "en": "The cheering mobs will never know how much you've sacrificed, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08557",
   "en": "Glad to hear it, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08558",
   "en": "I hope you can wait.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08559",
   "en": "You are totally shameless. You need your own line of greeting cards.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08560",
   "en": "That's the spirit, skipper. Keep a stiff upper something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08561",
   "en": "I'll warn you, though. I'm a hellcat off the battlefield, too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08562",
   "en": "Sleep tight, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08563",
   "en": "They're right, you know. We don't have much proof. My \"visions\" and the word of a rebellious Spectre.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08564",
   "en": "They've dismissed all my concerns out of hand. \"Visions.\" May as well have told them I divined it from entrails.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08565",
   "en": "It's frustrating, Ash. I wish I had proof. But by the time we have it, it'll be too late.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08566",
   "en": "I was a fool. They'll stick their heads in the sand, and it'll come down to us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08567",
   "en": "Ash, all I'm saying is that you were right and I was wrong. The Alliance does have to look out for number one.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08568",
   "en": "I don't know. Are you always this passive-aggressive?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08569",
   "en": "Look, I only said God had a plan so you'd understand my point. If this universe does have a plan, it needs a few revisions.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08570",
   "en": "Come on, Ash, it's no big deal. Couples fight all the time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08571",
   "en": "So we disagree on some things. It happens with every couple.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08572",
   "en": "I'm just venting, Ash. I'm not going to launch a coup when we get back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08573",
   "en": "Once they know the truth about Sovereign, they'll get involved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08574",
   "en": "When have politicians ever appreciated the military's sacrifices?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08575",
   "en": "We have to get everyone together on this. The Alliance can't take the Reapers alone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08576",
   "en": "Don't hold your breath. He's a politician. He'll do whatever's best for him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08577",
   "en": "Where do you need me, Chief?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08578",
   "en": "The galaxy may need me here, but I need you next to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08579",
   "en": "So when can I expect you to stop jerking me around?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08580",
   "en": "It's good to know where I stand with the galaxy. Where do I stand with you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08581",
   "en": "I understand, Chief. The galaxy isn't going to save itself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08582",
   "en": "There's some old saw about waiting and good things, isn't there?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08583",
   "en": "I'll just requisition myself some cold showers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08584",
   "en": "They think I'm nuts.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08585",
   "en": "We can convince them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08586",
   "en": "I just want to convince them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08587",
   "en": "Maybe I was just naive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08588",
   "en": "No, I haven't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08589",
   "en": "Back off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08590",
   "en": "There is no \"divine plan.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08591",
   "en": "I'm dubious.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08592",
   "en": "We need help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08593",
   "en": "Seems doubtful.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08594",
   "en": "And you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08595",
   "en": "I need you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08596",
   "en": "Be serious, Ash.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08597",
   "en": "What about you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08598",
   "en": "Barely.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08599",
   "en": "As long as you need.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08600",
   "en": "I should get back to my duties, skipper. Rifles don't maintain themselves. Not yet, anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08601",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Commander. I need to get my duties squared away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08602",
   "en": "I wouldn't mind talking more later, though.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08603",
   "en": "I don't care what you sleep with. Not after you tried to get me to do a threesome.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08604",
   "en": "I respect you as an officer. But keep me out of your egocentric little fantasies. Sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08605",
   "en": "My heart doesn't get broken, Shepard. Bruised a little, maybe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08606",
   "en": "Fleets of AI dreadnoughts? Who've exterminated all life dozens of times over?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08607",
   "en": "I think the odds are against us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08608",
   "en": "Damn straight we will, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08609",
   "en": "I don't plan to lie down and die, skipper. Don't worry about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08610",
   "en": "I don't plan to lie down and die, Commander. Don't worry about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08611",
   "en": "But I'm infantry. Against Reapers, my rifle may as well fire spitballs. I won't have a place in this war.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08612",
   "en": "That's what pisses me off. Not being able to shoot back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08613",
   "en": "Not sure I buy Dr. T'Soni's story. About her and her mom not talking. They're family, right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08614",
   "en": "Yeah, she's probably really bad at it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08615",
   "en": "Hey, want me to ask her about her sex life? Might be illuminating.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08616",
   "en": "Aw, no fun, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08617",
   "en": "No fun, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08618",
   "en": "I read you, Commander. I'll behave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08619",
   "en": "Hm. Scuttlebutt says otherwise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08620",
   "en": "No, I guess not.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08621",
   "en": "I know. But I'm not going to bet she's on our side just because Benezia didn't hug her enough. I'll keep an eye on her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08622",
   "en": "No offense. I appreciate the rescue. I just wish...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08623",
   "en": "Yes, Commander. Believe me, I understand that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08624",
   "en": "You did the best you could, Commander. It's my fault.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08625",
   "en": "If I'd been more alert, we wouldn't have been cut down by an ambush.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08626",
   "en": "Sir, they have flashlight heads.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08627",
   "en": "They have flashlight heads, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08628",
   "en": "Our training's supposed to make us able to adapt.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08629",
   "en": "I'll make sure it doesn't happen again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08630",
   "en": "Looking forward to it, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08631",
   "en": "Looking forward to it, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08632",
   "en": "We have an advantage. We know they're coming, and we know about their indoctrination.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08633",
   "en": "When it comes to the survival of humanity, who gives a rat's ass about odds? We're going to fight them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08634",
   "en": "Odds aren't the whole story. Who'd think one shore party and a platoon of salarians could take out a major base?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08635",
   "en": "I think she's being straight with us. Or, at least, I don't think she lies very often.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08636",
   "en": "I don't think she's used to teasing, good-natured or otherwise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08637",
   "en": "Is that the best way to spend your time, Chief?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08638",
   "en": "That's between you and her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08639",
   "en": "I'm not sure I believe it either. It's better to have her where we can see her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08640",
   "en": "Not everyone's as close to their family as you are.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08641",
   "en": "Not everyone has a happy family life.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08642",
   "en": "You wish we'd been able to save the rest of your unit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08643",
   "en": "They died. You lived. That happens in this job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08644",
   "en": "We came as soon as we got the distress call. Even with the fastest ship in the fleet...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08645",
   "en": "The geth are perfect ambushers. They don't move, they don't make noise-- they don't even breathe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08646",
   "en": "The answer seems plain enough to me. Be more alert.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08647",
   "en": "We never trained to fight synthetics. The geth haven't gone beyond the Veil in three centuries.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08648",
   "en": "Better than they were.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08649",
   "en": "Screw the odds.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08650",
   "en": "Odds aren't everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08651",
   "en": "We'll watch her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08652",
   "en": "Your family is tight.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08653",
   "en": "It might not matter.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08654",
   "en": "Don't be cruel.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08655",
   "en": "That wouldn't be appropriate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08656",
   "en": "That's none of my business.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08657",
   "en": "That we'd saved your unit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08658",
   "en": "Stop dwelling.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08659",
   "en": "We tried to get here sooner.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08660",
   "en": "Be more alert.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08661",
   "en": "You couldn't know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08662",
   "en": "No, ma'am. Well, maybe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08663",
   "en": "It won't happen again. And, uh, I have no interest in the lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08664",
   "en": "Anyway. Interested in a quick drink? It's a special occasion.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08665",
   "en": "Nah, you just happened by at the right time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08666",
   "en": "Skipper?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08667",
   "en": "We had to do this, Shepard. You know that. There was no other way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08668",
   "en": "And you'll always be the skipper to me. \"O Captain, my Captain...\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08669",
   "en": "Next time, I'll stick with Tennyson.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08670",
   "en": "Dad loved all those sappy poets. Mom was more into Plath.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08671",
   "en": "I'm not a \"word person,\" Shepard. Other people say what I mean better than I do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08672",
   "en": "We're mutineers, sailing a stolen warship into the most hostile system in the galaxy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08673",
   "en": "I couldn't blame the Council for calling us reckless or aggressive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08674",
   "en": "I've had some things to think about since coming aboard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08675",
